sequenceDiagram
  participant user as Browser / operator
  participant api as FastAPI
  participant disk as Private temporary directory
  participant helm as Helm
  participant kube as Kubernetes API
  user->>api: POST /api/deploy with Bearer token
  api->>api: Authenticate, validate namespace and request
  api->>disk: Write generated values with private permissions
  api->>helm: Lint all selected charts
  loop MinIO, Patroni, PgCat when enabled
    api->>helm: Upgrade/install and wait
    helm->>kube: Apply namespaced resources
    api->>kube: Confirm dependent StatefulSet readiness
  end
  api->>disk: Remove temporary files on success or failure
  alt All stages completed
    api-->>user: Success and release identity
  else Provisioning failed
    api-->>user: Error and completedReleases, inspect partial state
  end
